[heading]Version 0.5.0[/heading]

[list]
[*]Added a short trader-transport transition before travel, with an optional vehicle sound and arrival message.
[*]Added optional distance-based travel costs using configurable items, with gas as the default cost item when enabled.
[*]Multiplayer servers send cost settings to clients so destination labels can show the server-side travel cost.
[*]No save reset required.
[/list]
